<facsimile><graphic url="https://www.e-manuscripta.ch/i3f/v20/1079175/manifest"/></facsimile><text><body><div type="letter">
<pb facs="1079176" n="1"/>
  <opener><salute><lb/>Viro <choice><abbr>Illustriss.</abbr><expan>Illustrissimo</expan></choice> et <choice><abbr>Celeberr.<hi rend="sup">o</hi></abbr><expan>Celeberrimo</expan></choice> <choice><abbr>Jo:</abbr><expan>Johanni</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Bernoull<choice><orig><g ref="#j">j</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice></rs>
      <lb/>Petrus Antonius <rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Michelotti</rs> <abbr>S. P. D.</abbr></salute></opener>
  <p><lb/>Nuperrimis Tuis <rs key="B_991170515150705501" type="letter">Literis</rs> perfertur ad me <choice><abbr>Illustriss.</abbr><expan>Illustrissimum</expan></choice>
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnatum</rs> Tu<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>, <rs key="pers_DE-588-1216205728" type="person">Uxorem</rs> mult<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> admod<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>
      <lb/>opulentam duxisse, Teque <rs key="B_991170515150805501" type="letter">epistolam</rs> me<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> pridem
      <lb/>ad Temetips<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> datam accepisse. Promiseram,
      <lb/>me post mensem Te factur<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> certior<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> de
      <lb/>mea profectione in <rs key="place_VER-frankr" type="place">Galliam</rs>; idque facio
      <lb/>in pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>sentia. Nec dum decreta est dies profec<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tionis <choice><abbr>Ill&#x006D;&#x0303;i</abbr><expan>Illustrissimi</expan></choice> et <choice><abbr>Exc.<hi rend="sup"/>mi</abbr><expan>Excellentissimi</expan></choice> Viri <choice><abbr>Laur.</abbr><expan>Laurentii</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-121843858" type="person">Theupoli</rs>.
      <lb/>me quod attinet, statuo manere hic, tum
      <lb/>ut morem geram plurimis aliis meis Me<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>cenatibus (qui <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>gre me<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> discess<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> ferrent) t<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>
      <lb/>ut rebus meis studeam, et pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>sertim ut
      <lb/>summa ope nitar ne plurima
      <lb/>errata incidant in editione me<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>  <rs key="biblio_M3G2JA79" type="biblio">Dissertationis</rs>,
      <lb/>cui multa addidi, et quam propedi<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>lo sum
      <lb/>commissurus una cum peregregiis, perutilibusque
      <lb/>Dissertationibus Tuis <rs key="biblio_JAFFCHKU" type="biblio">de Motu Musculor<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs>,
      <lb/><rs key="biblio_W6BHQDM2" type="biblio">De Effervescentia, et Fermentatione</rs>. Statim
      <lb/>ac res erit ad umbilic<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> deducta mittam duo,
      <lb/>aut tria Exemplaria pro Te, Illustrissimo <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agna<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>to</rs>, et <choice><abbr>Clariss.</abbr><expan>Clarissimo</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-118656503" type="person">Filio</rs><note type="editorial" resp="SG">Daniel I Bernoulli sollte das dritte Exemplar erhalten. Wie Michelotti in seinem <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515150305501">Brief</rs> vom 12. April 1721 (p. 2) erklärt, konnte James Stirling dieses Exemplar nicht mitnehmen.</note> Tuo. Videbis me inseruisse
      <lb/>me<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> <rs key="biblio_M3G2JA79" type="biblio">Dissertationi</rs> non sol<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> ea, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> in <rs key="biblio_WCRRQGZT" type="biblio"><rs key="pers_DE-588-1055365613" type="person">Keilli<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs></rs>
      <lb/>docte, et scite animadvertisti, sed et illa
<pb facs="1079177" n="2"/>
      <lb/>immo illa pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>sertim qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> in <rs key="pers_DE-588-119507978" type="person"><choice><abbr>Jac.</abbr><expan>Jacobum</expan></choice> Jurin<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs><note type="editorial" resp="SG">Bernoullis Anmerkungen betreffen James Jurins <rs key="biblio_M6Z9EVAL" type="biblio"><hi rend="i">De motu aquarum fluentium</hi></rs>. Eine Abschrift der Abhandlung von Michelottis Hand ist in der UB Basel erhalten (<ref target="https://doi.org/10.7891/e-manuscripta-77678">L Ia 750:Bl.317a-334b</ref>).</note> annotasti circa deter<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>minationem velocitatis aqu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> ex vase effluentis ita
      <lb/>ut sper<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> ejusmodi Tuis annotationibus a me limatis
      <lb/><choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>quos verum <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>stimatores intellecturos esse quant<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> Tua
      <lb/>demonstrandi methodus <rs key="pers_DE-588-1089586140" type="person">Newtonian<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>stet.</p>
  <p><lb/>Venio ad aureas Tuas <rs key="biblio_W6BHQDM2 biblio_JAFFCHKU biblio_WIW87HR7" type="biblio">Dissertationes</rs>, quas (in iis qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
      <lb/>ad lingu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> latin<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> eleganti<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> spectant) Tuo jussu emen<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>davi. Addidi aliquas annotationes Lectoribus; uti spero,
      <lb/>pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>sertim Tyronibus haud inutiles, Tibique Vir Ce<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>leberrime nequaqu<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> ingratas. Subjeci Tentamen <choice><abbr>Jac.</abbr><expan>Jacobi</expan></choice>
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-1055365613" type="person">Keilii</rs> <rs key="biblio_W3P7C2J2" type="biblio">de Motu Musculor<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs>, in quod, non sol<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> ea,
      <lb/>qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> Ingeniosus <rs key="pers_DE-588-117589144" type="person">Filius</rs> Tuus, sed et qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> ipse animadverti,
      <lb/>annotavi. Rogo ut clarius ment<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> tu<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> mihi ape<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>rias in iis, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> in memorat<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-1055365613" type="person">Keilii</rs> Tentamen
      <lb/>annotasti. Falsum est, inquis, vim inflationis in
      <lb/>ideo minorem esse quia in minori quantitate fluid<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>
      <lb/>iniiciatur, nam qu<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> elastic<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> ad eand<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> densitat<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> sit
      <lb/>redigend<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> in parvis vesiculis ut in magna vesica simi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>lem figuram cum minimis illis vesiculis habente,
      <lb/>necesse omnino est, ut ad inflandas parvas vesiculas
      <lb/>ead<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> vis inflationis adhibeatur <hi rend="u">qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> ad magn<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice></hi>. Qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>ro
      <lb/>cur vis inflationis minor sit in minoribus vesiculis
      <lb/>qu<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> in majori vesica similem cum illis ipsis vesiculis
      <lb/>figuram habente? Qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>ro cur materia elastica ad
      <lb/>eand<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> densitat<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> sit redigenda in parvis vesiculis ac in magna vesica?</p>
  <p><lb/><choice><abbr>Ingeniosiss.<hi rend="sup">am</hi></abbr><expan>Ingeniosissimam</expan></choice> <add>Tuam</add> <rs key="biblio_WIW87HR7" type="biblio">de Nutritione</rs> Disputation<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice>, inpr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>sentiar<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>
<pb facs="1079178" n="3"/>
      <lb/>non edam, propterea quod tempus me deficit. Eam
      <lb/>itaque edi curabo qu<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>lo committam Usus Scien<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ti<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> Secretionis Animalis in edisserendis, et agitan<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dis Humani Corporis <choice><orig><g ref="#AE">Æ</g></orig><reg>Ae</reg></choice>gritudinibus Specimina aliquot,
      <lb/>qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> mihi limanda supersunt. Tuar<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> et me<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> Disser<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tationis editio<del>ne</del> <choice><sic>imchoabitur</sic><corr>inchoabitur</corr></choice> post 20 circiter dies,
      <lb/>ideoque Tu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> <rs key="B_991170515150505501" type="letter">liter<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs>, si statim ad me rescribere poteris,
      <lb/>ad me perferentur antequ<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> eadem ista editio per<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>fecta sit. Hinc mittere etiam statuo ea, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> de
      <lb/>velocitate Sanguinis determinanda in vena cava,
      <lb/>in aorta, in arteriis cordi proximis, et a corde dis<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tantibus profert <rs key="pers_DE-588-119507978" type="person">Jurinus</rs>; qui meo judicio per<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>peram deducit ex sua demonstratione
      <lb/>major<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> esse Sanguinis mot<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>, sive impet<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> in ar<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>teriis omnibus capillaribus simul sumptis, quam
      <lb/>in ipsa Aorta; item major<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> in capillaribus Venis
      <lb/>quam arteriis. Nam ipse post alios demonstravi
      <lb/>sanguinis velocitat<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> major<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> esse in aort<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
      <lb/>trunco quam in arteriis capillaribus simul sumptis, <subst><del>et</del><add>item</add></subst>
      <lb/>majorem in arteriis capillaribus simul sumptis
      <lb/>quam in venis capillaribus. Porro falso deducit
      <lb/>majorem esse Sanguinis impetum in Vena quavis,
      <lb/>qu<choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice>m in arteria ei ven<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> respondente, et proinde
<pb facs="1079179" n="4"/>
      <lb/>maujor<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> in Vena Cava quam in Aorta. Quis, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>so,
      <lb/>h<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>c dabit? Nemin<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> enim latet major<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> esse
      <lb/>velocitat<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> Sanguinis in Aorta qu<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> in vena Cava.
      <lb/>Rogo Vir Celeberrime ut attente legas omnia qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-119507978" type="person">Jurinus</rs> profert de motu aqu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>, de motu San<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>guinis, et de methodo inveniendi mot<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>
      <lb/>aëris ex Pulmone effluentis. Si enim quas in
      <lb/>chart<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> conjicies annotationes ad me brevi
      <lb/>perferentur, add<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> <rs key="biblio_M3G2JA79" type="biblio">Dissertationi</rs> me<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>: si id fie<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ri non poterit, quando Tibi supererit tempus
      <lb/>ad me transmittes easd<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> annotationes una
      <lb/>cum <rs key="biblio_M6Z9EVAL" type="biblio">Schedio</rs><note type="editorial" resp="SG">Michelotti legte diesem Brief ein weiteres Exemplar von Jurins Abhandlung bei. Bernoulli berichtet im <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515150505501">Brief</rs> vom 10. August 1720 (pp. 1 und 3), dem Exemplar habe die Figurentafel gefehlt. Da er bereits eine Abschrift besass, habe er die Beilage am Tag nach dem Empfang über Mailand zurückgeschickt. Im <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515150405501">Brief</rs> vom 22. September 1720 (p. 1) bestätigt Michelotti, dass er sie von <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-117589144">Nicolaus II Bernoulli</rs> zurückerhalten habe.</note> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119507978" type="person">Juriniano</rs>, quod ad Te mittere
      <lb/>Statuo fretus Tua benignitate promittensque
      <lb/>solvere h<choice><orig><g ref="#ihat">î</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice>c <rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Venetiis</rs>, vel ubi lubebit, quicquid ero<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>gabis in accipienda hac mea crassa epistola.
      <lb/>Nolo enim Te sumptibus onerare.</p>
  <p><lb/>Tand<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> devenio ad <choice><abbr>Clariss.</abbr><expan>Clarissimum</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-118656503" type="person">Fili<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs> Tu<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>, de quo gaudeo,
      <lb/>absolutur<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> esse curs<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> su<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> Medic<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>, editurumque
      <lb/>pulcherrim<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice>, ut opinor, Dissertation<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> <rs key="biblio_KGZSMV2E" type="biblio">de Respi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ratione</rs>. Quando ei erit in animo venire in <rs key="place_KON-italie" type="place">Italiam</rs>,
      <lb/>egometipse e<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> libentissime excipiam, domique
      <lb/>me<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> ut degat rogo. Ipse pro habitatione (qu<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice>
      <lb/>esse pulchr<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> novit <choice><abbr>Illustr.<hi rend="sup"/></abbr><expan>Illustrissimus</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnatus</rs>) nihil solvet,
      <lb/>meosque libros legendi, et meos <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>gros visitandi
<pb facs="1079180" n="5"/>
      <lb/>plenam habebit facultatem. Poterit istinc disce<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dere, vel sub fin<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>statis, vel sub initi<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> veris.
      <lb/>Mitte ips<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> Vir Amicissime. Redibit enim post
      <lb/>un<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>, duos, aut tres annos in Patri<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice>, ibique pros<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>pere Medicin<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> exercere, atque docere pote<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>rit. Eum dilig<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> tanqu<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> si esset meus Filius.
      <lb/>Si iter feciss<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> in <rs key="place_VER-frankr" type="place">Gallias</rs> procul dubio in reditu
      <lb/>venissem istuc Te officiosissime, et amicissime
      <lb/>salutat<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>, atque deosculat<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice> una cum Ami<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>cissimo <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnato</rs> Tuo, cui salut<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> plurim<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> mitto.
      <lb/>Gratias ago maximas pro generosissima Tua
      <lb/>oblatione, quam fecisti de me humaniter
      <lb/>recipiendo in domo Tua.</p>
  <p><lb/>Tand<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> ut in res <rs key="pers_DE-588-119507978" type="person">Jurinianas</rs> attente animadvertas
      <lb/>adhuc rogo. Qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> enim annotabis si me<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> <rs key="biblio_M3G2JA79" type="biblio">Disserta<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tioni</rs> inserere non potero, add<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> alteri me<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
      <lb/>opell<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice><note type="editorial" resp="SG">Michelotti plante eine Schrift darüber, wie sich der Blutfluss durch Aderlass beschleunigen lasse. Schon im <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515152905501">Brief</rs> vom 26. November 1717 (p. 1) hatte er Bernoulli gebeten, in diesem Zusammenhang eine Aussage <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-117584363">Lorenzo Bellinis</rs> zur Blutströmung in den Arterien zu prüfen.</note>, quam meditor de sanguinis missione,
      <lb/>seu de Velocitate Sanguinis augenda per
      <lb/>mission<choice><orig><g ref="#em">ē</g></orig><reg>em</reg></choice> Sanguinis: quam opell<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice> examini Tuo
      <lb/>ali<choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice>s submitt<choice><orig><g ref="#am">ā</g></orig><reg>am</reg></choice>.</p> <closer><salute>Vale Vir Illustrissime, mihique
